    {
      "id": "ple_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -284
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Plexus\n\nA flock of boids (Simulation) wanders the canvas. Connect Points joins every pair closer than `distance`: lines fade (`fade`) and thin (`taper`) as they stretch, and `maxLinks` keeps each bird to its few nearest.\n\nSwitch Connect Points to `nearest` so no bird is ever alone.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Plexus\n\nA flock of boids (Simulation) wanders the canvas. Connect Points joins every pair closer than `distance`: lines fade (`fade`) and thin (`taper`) as they stretch, and `maxLinks` keeps each bird to its few nearest.\n\nSwitch Connect Points to `nearest` so no bird is ever alone.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 220
      }
    },
